===============================================================================
                            WhisperJAV v{{VERSION}}
                Japanese AV Subtitle Generator with AI
===============================================================================

Thank you for installing WhisperJAV.

The full guide for this installer is on the web:
https://meizhong986.github.io/WhisperJAV/guides/installation_windows_standalone/

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QUICK START
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Double-click the "WhisperJAV v{{VERSION}}" desktop shortcut, or
   WhisperJAV-GUI.exe in the install folder.
2. Click "Add File(s)" or "Add Folder" and choose your videos.
3. In the "Transcription Mode" tab, choose a mode (balanced is a good
   start). The "Ensemble Mode" tab runs pass 1, and also pass 2 when you
   tick "Pass 2", then combines the two.
4. Click "Start". It runs Ensemble Mode when the "Ensemble Mode" tab is
   open, and Transcription Mode when the "Transcription Mode" tab is open.
5. The subtitles are written next to each video while "Save next to source
   video" is ticked (the default), else into the folder you chose.

The first time a pipeline needs a model, WhisperJAV downloads it (for
example about 3 GB for Whisper large-v3). Later runs reuse it.

